    "medium_raw": "Wool baize, backed with cotton and bound woollen cloth, appliquéd with cotton and woollen cloth, gimp and copper sequins, and painted in Indian ink and watercolour, brass",
    "classification": "Hanging",
    "styles": [],
    "categories": [
